---
import Layout from "../../layouts/default.astro";
---

<Layout>
	<a href="/awesome" class="w-full text-center underline">
		back to main list
	</a>
	<div class="text-3xl w-full text-center p-4">Cool Sites I've Found</div>
	<div class="flex flex-wrap w-full items-center gap-8 p-4 justify-center">
		<div class="border-2 border-fg flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 p-4 max-w-md">
			<a href="https://ooo.eeeee.ooo/" class="text-2xl p-4">
				ooo.eeeee.ooo
			</a>
			<div class="text-md">i'm thinkin miku</div>
		</div>
		<div class="border-2 border-fg flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 p-4 max-w-md">
			<a href="https://88x31.kate.pet/" class="text-2xl p-4">
				kate's 88x31 button archive
			</a>
			<div class="text-md">yes, i like 88x31s</div>
		</div>
		<div class="border-2 border-fg flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 p-4 max-w-md">
			<a href="https://88x31.nl/index.html" class="text-2xl p-4">
				88x31 Collection
			</a>
			<div class="text-md">yes, another one</div>
		</div>
		<div class="border-2 border-fg flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 p-4 max-w-md">
			<a href="https://forum.dangerousthings.com/" class="text-2xl p-4">
				The Dangerous Things Forum
			</a>
			<div class="text-md">I've spent too much time on here. No, I have no plans to do better</div>
		</div>
		<div class="border-2 border-fg flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 p-4 max-w-md">
			<a href="https://vrcdn.live/" class="text-2xl p-4">
				vrcdn
			</a>
			<div class="text-md">love these guys! been friends with a good number of djs that love it too</div>
		</div>
		<div class="border-2 border-fg flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 p-4 max-w-md">
			<a href="https://xenia.efi.pages.gay/" class="text-2xl p-4">
				xenia
			</a>
			<div class="text-md">Linux has another mascot! and shes trans! like me! and a fox! like m- wait i'm not a furry</div>
		</div>
		<div class="border-2 border-fg flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 p-4 max-w-md">
			<a href="https://www.scd31.com/" class="text-2xl p-4">
				The Cat House
			</a>
			<div class="text-md">Found her from her diy electrolysis machine, super cool gal!</div>
		</div>
		<div class="border-2 border-fg flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 p-4 max-w-md">
			<a href="https://freeplay.floof.company/" class="text-2xl p-4 contain-content">
				FREEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE
			</a>
			<div class="text-md">FOPS FOPS FOPS FOPS FOPS FOPS FOPS FOPS FOPS FOPS FOPS</div>
		</div>
		<div class="border-2 border-fg flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 p-4 max-w-md">
			<a href="https://volpeon.ink" class="text-2xl p-4">
				Volpeon
			</a>
			<div class="text-md">Made cool fops emojis, and has a really cool art style. I love vector graphics</div>
		</div>
		<div class="border-2 border-fg flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 p-4 max-w-md">
			<a href="https://delphi.tools" class="text-2xl p-4">
				Delphi Tools
			</a>
			<div class="text-md">Many many many many useful little tools, very handy</div>
		</div>
		<div class="border-2 border-fg flex-col items-center text-center gap-4 p-4 max-w-md">
			<a href="https://omni.vi/" class="text-2xl p-4">
				Omni
			</a>
			<div class="text-md">Really cool art</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
